# Local history, agent state and credentials never enter the root build context.
**/.git
**/.context
**/.codex
**/.agents
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.doppler
**/.config
**/.aws
**/.ssh
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*credentials*.json

# Build from source with container dependencies and fresh compiler output.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.pnpm-store
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/.vite
**/.vitest
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/logs
**/*.log
**/*.tgz
**/*.test.ts
**/tests
